WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.148
A first machine: a small Ubuntu 24.04 server, built from the official cloud image.

00:00:08.248 --> 00:00:15.041
Its card says what it needs: memory, CPUs, disk, and how it installs.

00:00:15.141 --> 00:00:19.801
The star adds it to My VMs, your own short list.

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:25.724
Install automatically: no questions, no installer to click through.

00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:32.452
Every action is a job with a live log, and it keeps running if you close the page.

00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:42.489
It downloads the image and checks it, boots it once with cloud-init, then logs in over SSH to verify it.

00:00:42.589 --> 00:00:50.007
Done: installed and verified.

00:00:50.107 --> 00:00:55.837
It is in My VMs, and already running.

00:00:55.937 --> 00:01:01.840
Next: its console, in the browser.
